message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names. See "Citation metadata" in the contributing guide of the
  documentation for who is an author and how to add or correct your entry.
title: Cloud Registry
abstract: >-
  Cloud Registry is a registry of web services for projects, networks and
  infrastructures that implements the GA4GH Service Registry API, so that
  clients can discover services and their API types, versions and operators
  in one place. Anyone can read the entries; users authenticated with a
  trusted OpenID Connect provider can register and manage services, and
  admins can verify them. It is built with FOCA and deployed with Docker
  Compose or its Helm chart.
